{"name":"Lhesper","status":"ok","title":"Lhesper","pageId":77944,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Lhesper</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS-p77_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p77-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p132-133_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p132-133-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ruined town</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Western <a href=\"/wiki/Shaar\" title=\"Shaar\">Shaar</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"races\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Races</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Yuan-ti\" title=\"Yuan-ti\">Yuan-ti</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Organizations_in_Lhesper\" title=\"Category:Organizations in Lhesper\">Organizations in  Lhesper</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Lhesper</b> was a ruined town on the shore of <a href=\"/wiki/Lake_Lhespen\" title=\"Lake Lhespen\">Lake Lhespen</a> in the western region of the <a href=\"/wiki/Shaar\" title=\"Shaar\">Shaar</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS-p77_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p77-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p132-133_2-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p132-133-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Activities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Activities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lhesper?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Lhesper was founded in the <a href=\"/wiki/-373_DR\" title=\"-373 DR\">Year of Whispering Stones, −373 DR</a>, by refugees from <a href=\"/wiki/Lapaliiya\" title=\"Lapaliiya\">Lapaliiya</a> who were fleeing plague. The city remained independent until th <a href=\"/wiki/297_DR\" title=\"297 DR\">Year of the Wailing Mothers, 297 DR</a>, when the army of Qysara <a href=\"/wiki/Shoon_V\" title=\"Shoon V\">Shoon V</a> marched across the Shaar conquering everything in their path. The city would not regain its independence until the <a href=\"/wiki/437_DR\" title=\"437 DR\">Year of Silver Holly, 437 DR</a>, and again in the <a href=\"/wiki/451_DR\" title=\"451 DR\">Year of Unleashed Fears, 451 DR</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p132-133_2-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p132-133-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The town was destroyed by a pack of rampaging <a href=\"/wiki/Gnoll\" title=\"Gnoll\">gnolls</a> in 7th century <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/DR\" title=\"DR\">DR</a>. Around the <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Year_of_Wild_Magic\" title=\"Year of Wild Magic\">year of Wild Magic</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Yuan-ti\" title=\"Yuan-ti\">Yuan-ti</a> began to move into the area, searching for some mysterious buried object.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SS-p77_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SS-p77-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Activities\">Activities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Activities\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lhesper?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Activities\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>As of the <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">Year of Wild Magic, 1372 DR</a>, Lhesper was taken over by members from the <a href=\"/wiki/Coiled_Cabal\" title=\"Coiled Cabal\">Coiled Cabal</a> who were searching for the <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRW1lcmFsZHNfb2ZfTWVycnNoYXVsaz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Emeralds of Merrshaulk (page does not exist)\">Emeralds of Merrshaulk</span>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-SK-p132-133_2-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SK-p132-133-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lhesper?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i> <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Lhesper?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-SS-p77-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p77_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p77_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SS-p77_1-2\">1.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Thomas_Reid\" title=\"Thomas Reid\">Thomas Reid</a> (October 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Shining_South_(sourcebook)\" title=\"Shining South (sourcebook)\">Shining South</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 77. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3492-1\">0-7869-3492-1</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-SK-p132-133-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p132-133_2-0\">2.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p132-133_2-1\">2.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p132-133_2-2\">2.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-SK-p132-133_2-3\">2.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Eric_L._Boyd\" title=\"Eric L. Boyd\">Eric L. Boyd</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Darrin_Drader\" title=\"Darrin Drader\">Darrin Drader</a> (July 2004). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Serpent_Kingdoms\" title=\"Serpent Kingdoms\">Serpent Kingdoms</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), pp. 132–133. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-3277-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-3277-5\">0-7869-3277-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260516050847\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.130 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 870/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3405/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1363/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/100\nUns